  "captionCues": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Keelwatch connects fleet records, evidence, people and work.\nIndependent full-stack project · real local app · synthetic data.",
      "chapter": "Access and product context",
      "end": 7.281
    },
    {
      "start": 7.281,
      "text": "Demo Manager can perform operational changes.\nThe API resolves the account and enforces its permissions.",
      "end": 15.845
    },
    {
      "start": 15.845,
      "text": "Overview highlights documentary risks and next actions.\nIt is not a dashboard of every business module.",
      "end": 21.947
    },
    {
      "start": 21.947,
      "text": "Start with a fleet record.\nOne vessel will connect the rest of this journey.",
      "chapter": "Fleet registration",
      "end": 30.473
    },
    {
      "start": 30.473,
      "text": "Register a synthetic vessel with a unique demo registry number.\nThe same workspace will hold evidence, plans and maintenance.",
      "end": 36.312
    },
    {
      "start": 36.312,
      "text": "The confirmed record now appears in Fleet.\nOpen it to continue the same operational story.",
      "end": 43.639
    },
    {
      "start": 43.639,
      "text": "A new vessel starts with missing certificate evidence.\nCompliance state is derived from recorded dates in UTC.",
      "chapter": "Compliance and notifications",
      "end": 57.36
    },
    {
      "start": 57.36,
      "text": "Record the existing safety-equipment certificate type.\nThis example expires in 14 days; file attachments are disabled.",
      "end": 65.463
    },
    {
      "start": 65.463,
      "text": "The saved evidence changes the state to Expiring soon.\nThe reason and dates explain why attention is needed.",
      "end": 82.2
    },
    {
      "start": 82.2,
      "text": "The fleet-wide risk queue can locate this vessel.\nIts dates and derived state lead back to the same record.",
      "end": 92.961
    },
    {
      "start": 92.961,
      "text": "The bounded background check reconciles active notifications.\nThis demo delivery log does not send external email.",
      "end": 106.473
    },
    {
      "start": 106.473,
      "text": "Create a synthetic crew profile in the fleet-wide registry.\nA CrewMember is not a login account or access role.",
      "chapter": "Crew qualifications and planning",
      "end": 124.323
    },
    {
      "start": 124.323,
      "text": "Record dated demo safety familiarization evidence.\nThe ledger explains validity; it does not certify real fitness.",
      "end": 132.142
    },
    {
      "start": 132.142,
      "text": "The qualification is saved with its history and validity dates.\nNext, connect this profile to a plan for the vessel.",
      "end": 137.75
    },
    {
      "start": 137.75,
      "text": "Return through Fleet to the same vessel.\nNext, select the crew profile and prepare its assignment dates.",
      "end": 145.555
    },
    {
      "start": 145.555,
      "text": "Choose the crew profile created earlier.\nThe plan connects that profile to this vessel.",
      "end": 154.033
    },
    {
      "start": 154.033,
      "text": "The selected deck function and both dates define this plan.\nEvaluate its requirements before deciding to save.",
      "end": 160.715
    },
    {
      "start": 160.715,
      "text": "Evaluate demo requirements across the whole planned period.\nAny gaps are advisory; this does not approve boarding.",
      "end": 172.371
    },
    {
      "start": 172.371,
      "text": "The dated assignment plan is now attached to the vessel.\nPlanning is separate from actual presence on board.",
      "end": 182.577
    },
    {
      "start": 182.577,
      "text": "Maintenance work belongs to this same vessel.\nCreate an order, assign an eligible access user and follow progress.",
      "chapter": "Maintenance lifecycle",
      "end": 193.542
    },
    {
      "start": 193.542,
      "text": "The responsible maintenance user is an access-account user,\nnot the crew profile created earlier. The target date enables planning.",
      "end": 200.493
    },
    {
      "start": 200.493,
      "text": "Creation is confirmed: the order is Open.\nOpen the record to act on saved details and inspect its history.",
      "end": 210.177
    },
    {
      "start": 210.177,
      "text": "Planning confirms the saved responsible user and target date.",
      "end": 219.008
    },
    {
      "start": 219.008,
      "text": "Start work moves the saved order into In progress.",
      "end": 227.891
    },
    {
      "start": 227.891,
      "text": "Closing completes this order. Its final state and history remain readable.",
      "end": 238.023
    },
    {
      "start": 238.023,
      "text": "Activity connects vessel, certificate, crew plan and maintenance changes.\nThe confirmed facts belong to the same vessel workspace.",
      "chapter": "Activity and Auditor",
      "end": 245.228
    },
    {
      "start": 245.228,
      "text": "History identifies the shared Demo Manager account.\nIt does not identify the individual visitor or browser tab.",
      "end": 251.629
    },
    {
      "start": 251.629,
      "text": "Switch to Demo Auditor to inspect the same records.\nChanging roles clears the previous account session.",
      "end": 258.558
    },
    {
      "start": 258.558,
      "text": "Demo Auditor inspects the same vessel and certificate evidence.\nOperational write forms are absent for this read-only role.",
      "end": 267.007
    },
    {
      "start": 267.007,
      "text": "The same completed order remains readable with its history.\nRead access and write permissions are enforced by the API.",
      "end": 273.435
    },
    {
      "start": 273.435,
      "text": "A direct Auditor update also returns 403 in the script check.\nThe vessel and its Activity remain unchanged.",
      "end": 280.295
    },
    {
      "start": 280.295,
      "text": "Continue with the separate Maintenance conflict/recovery video.\nExplore the case, demo and source; local footage does not prove capacity.",
      "end": 287.513
    }
  ],
